{
  "title": "InferLoadedEntry",
  "description": "The LOADED payload a CatalogEntry resolves to - what a `loader.load(catalog)` result map holds, as opposed to the handle-hybrid leaf InferCatalogLeaf materializes on the catalog itself. A bare path string is classified by its file suffix exactly as LeafForPath does, but resolves to the raw resource for every type: a value type's LOAD result is its decoded value (`unknown` for `json`), not the `AssetRef` wrapper its catalog property holds. Descriptors and explicit configs delegate to InferAssetResource unchanged.",
